{"n":2,"title":"The map of machine learning","part":"A","partName":"The big picture","words":918,"minutes":5,"sections":[{"id":"h-21-supervised-learning","title":"2.1 Supervised learning"},{"id":"h-22-unsupervised-learning","title":"2.2 Unsupervised learning"},{"id":"h-23-reinforcement-learning","title":"2.3 Reinforcement learning"},{"id":"h-24-side-by-side","title":"2.4 Side by side"},{"id":"h-25-choosing-the-family","title":"2.5 Choosing the family"},{"id":"h-26-self-supervised-learning","title":"2.6 Self-supervised learning"}],"speechHash":"28fda11c","fa":{"total":35,"translated":35},"html":"<p><strong><span data-s=\"0\" data-w=\"0\">Purpose.</span></strong> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"0\">When</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"1\">you</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"2\">meet</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"3\">a</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"4\">new</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"5\">technique,</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"6\">you</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"7\">should</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"8\">know</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"9\">which</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"10\">family</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"11\">it</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"12\">belongs</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"13\">to</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"14\">and</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"15\">what</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"16\">kind</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"17\">of</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"18\">problem</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"19\">it</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"20\">solves.</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"0\">This</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"1\">chapter</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"2\">is</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"3\">the</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"4\">map.</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"0\">Later</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"1\">chapters</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"2\">fill</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"3\">in</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"4\">the</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"5\">territory.</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>هدف.</strong> وقتی با یک تکنیک تازه روبه‌رو می‌شوی باید بدانی به کدام خانواده تعلق دارد و چه نوع مسئله‌ای را حل می‌کند. این فصل نقشه است. فصل‌های بعدی قلمرو را پر می‌کنند.</div>\n<p><strong><span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"0\">Key</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"1\">ideas</span></strong></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>ایده‌های کلیدی</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"0\">Supervised</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"1\">learning</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"2\">learns</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"3\">from</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"4\">examples</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"5\">with</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"6\">the</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"7\">right</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"8\">answer.</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"0\">Its</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"1\">two</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"2\">tasks</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"3\">are</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"4\">regression</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"5\">(predict</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"6\">a</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"7\">number)</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"8\">and</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"9\">classification</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"10\">(predict</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"11\">a</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"12\">category).</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">یادگیری نظارت‌شده از نمونه‌هایی با جواب درست یاد می‌گیرد. دو کارش رگرسیون (پیش‌بینی یک عدد) و دسته‌بندی (پیش‌بینی یک دسته) است.</div></li>\n<li><span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"0\">Unsupervised</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"1\">learning</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"2\">has</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"3\">no</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"4\">answers</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"5\">and</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"6\">finds</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"7\">structure:</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"8\">clusters,</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"9\">unusual</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"10\">cases,</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"11\">simpler</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"12\">descriptions.</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">یادگیری نظارت‌نشده جواب ندارد و ساختار پیدا می‌کند: خوشه‌ها، موارد غیرعادی، توصیف‌های ساده‌تر.</div></li>\n<li><span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"0\">Reinforcement</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"1\">learning</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"2\">learns</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"3\">from</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"4\">rewards</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"5\">by</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"6\">trial</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"7\">and</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"8\">error.</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">یادگیری تقویتی با آزمون و خطا از پاداش‌ها یاد می‌گیرد.</div></li>\n<li><span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"1\">first</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"2\">question</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"3\">to</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"4\">ask</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"5\">about</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"6\">any</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"7\">problem</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"8\">is:</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"9\">do</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"10\">I</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"11\">have</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"12\">the</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"13\">right</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"14\">answers</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"15\">for</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"16\">past</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"17\">cases?</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">اولین سؤالی که درباره‌ی هر مسئله باید بپرسی این است: آیا برای موردهای گذشته جواب درست دارم؟</div></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"assets/ml-map.png\" alt=\"Map of machine learning: three ways to learn, their types and models\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n<p><span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"0\">Read</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"1\">the</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"2\">map</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"3\">from</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"4\">left</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"5\">to</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"6\">right.</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"0\">Machine</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"1\">learning</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"2\">splits</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"3\">into</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"4\">three</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"5\">ways</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"6\">to</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"7\">learn,</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"8\">each</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"9\">into</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"10\">types,</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"11\">each</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"12\">with</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"13\">its</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"14\">models.</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"0\">Course</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"1\">1</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"2\">of</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"3\">Ng's</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"4\">specialization</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"5\">starts</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"6\">at</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"7\">the</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"8\">highlighted</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"9\">Regression</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"10\">box.</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"0\">Course</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"1\">2</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"2\">adds</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"3\">neural</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"4\">networks</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"5\">and</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"6\">trees,</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"7\">and</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"8\">course</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"9\">3</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"10\">adds</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"11\">clustering,</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"12\">anomaly</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"13\">detection</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"14\">and</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"15\">reinforcement</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"16\">learning.</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">نقشه را از چپ به راست بخوان. یادگیری ماشین به سه روش یادگیری تقسیم می‌شود، هرکدام به چند نوع، و هر نوع به مدل‌هایش. درس 1 تخصص Ng از کادر برجسته‌ی Regression شروع می‌شود. درس 2 شبکه‌های عصبی و درخت‌ها را اضافه می‌کند و درس 3 خوشه‌بندی، تشخیص ناهنجاری و یادگیری تقویتی.</div>\n<h4 id=\"h-21-supervised-learning\"><span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"0\">2.1</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"1\">Supervised</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"2\">learning</span></h4><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">2.1 یادگیری نظارت‌شده</div>\n<p><span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"0\">In</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"1\">supervised</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"2\">learning</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"3\">each</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"4\">training</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"5\">example</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"6\">is</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"7\">a</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"8\">pair:</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"9\">an</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"10\">input</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"11\">x</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"12\">and</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"13\">the</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"14\">right</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"15\">answer</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"16\">y</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"17\">(the</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"18\">label).</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"1\">algorithm</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"2\">learns</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"3\">the</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"4\">mapping</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"5\">from</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"6\">x</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"7\">to</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"8\">y,</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"9\">so</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"10\">that</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"11\">it</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"12\">can</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"13\">predict</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"14\">y</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"15\">for</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"16\">an</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"17\">input</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"18\">it</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"19\">has</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"20\">never</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"21\">seen.</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"0\">Ng</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"1\">says</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"2\">that</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"3\">about</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"4\">99%</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"5\">of</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"6\">the</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"7\">economic</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"8\">value</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"9\">created</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"10\">by</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"11\">machine</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"12\">learning</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"13\">today</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"14\">comes</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"15\">from</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"16\">this</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"17\">family.</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">در یادگیری نظارت‌شده هر نمونه‌ی آموزشی یک زوج است: ورودی <code>x</code> و جواب درست <code>y</code> (برچسب). الگوریتم نگاشت <code>x</code> به <code>y</code> را یاد می‌گیرد تا بتواند <code>y</code> را برای ورودی‌ای که هرگز ندیده پیش‌بینی کند. Ng می‌گوید حدود 99٪ ارزش اقتصادی‌ای که امروز یادگیری ماشین می‌سازد از همین خانواده می‌آید.</div>\n<p><span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"0\">It</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"1\">comes</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"2\">in</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"3\">two</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"4\">tasks:</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">دو کار دارد:</div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"0\">Regression</span></strong> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"1\">predicts</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"2\">a</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"3\">number</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"4\">from</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"5\">infinitely</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"6\">many</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"7\">possible</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"8\">values.</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"0\">A</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"1\">house</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"2\">price</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"3\">from</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"4\">its</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"5\">size.</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"0\">A</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"1\">monthly</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"2\">loan</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"3\">cost</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"4\">from</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"5\">the</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"6\">amount</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"7\">and</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"8\">the</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"9\">term.</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>رگرسیون</strong> یک عدد را از میان بی‌نهایت مقدار ممکن پیش‌بینی می‌کند. قیمت خانه از روی اندازه‌اش. هزینه‌ی ماهانه‌ی وام از روی مبلغ و مدت.</div></li>\n<li><strong><span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"0\">Classification</span></strong> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"1\">predicts</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"2\">a</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"3\">category</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"4\">from</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"5\">a</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"6\">small</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"7\">set.</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"0\">Spam</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"1\">or</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"2\">not</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"3\">spam.</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"0\">A</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"1\">tumour</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"2\">that</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"3\">is</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"4\">benign</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"5\">(0)</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"6\">or</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"7\">malignant</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"8\">(1).</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"1\">classes</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"2\">need</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"3\">not</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"4\">be</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"5\">numbers</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"6\">(cat</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"7\">or</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"8\">dog),</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"9\">and</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"10\">there</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"11\">can</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"12\">be</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"13\">more</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"14\">than</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"15\">two</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"16\">(Gmail's</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"17\">tabs:</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"18\">primary,</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"19\">social,</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"20\">promotions).</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"0\">With</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"1\">two</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"2\">inputs,</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"3\">the</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"4\">algorithm</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"5\">draws</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"6\">a</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"7\">boundary</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"8\">line</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"9\">between</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"10\">the</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"11\">classes.</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>دسته‌بندی</strong> یک دسته را از یک مجموعه‌ی کوچک پیش‌بینی می‌کند. اسپم یا غیراسپم. تومور خوش‌خیم (0) یا بدخیم (1). دسته‌ها لازم نیست عدد باشند (گربه یا سگ) و می‌توانند بیش از دو تا باشند (تب‌های Gmail: اصلی، اجتماعی، تبلیغات). با دو ورودی، الگوریتم یک خط مرزی بین دسته‌ها می‌کشد.</div></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"h-22-unsupervised-learning\"><span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"0\">2.2</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"1\">Unsupervised</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"2\">learning</span></h4><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">2.2 یادگیری نظارت‌نشده</div>\n<p><span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"1\">data</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"2\">has</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"3\">inputs</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"4\">only.</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"0\">Nobody</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"1\">tells</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"2\">the</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"3\">algorithm</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"4\">what</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"5\">the</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"6\">answers</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"7\">are,</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"8\">so</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"9\">it</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"10\">looks</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"11\">for</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"12\">structure</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"13\">by</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"14\">itself.</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"0\">Ng's</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"1\">examples:</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"2\">Google</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"3\">News</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"4\">puts</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"5\">articles</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"6\">that</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"7\">share</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"8\">words</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"9\">(panda,</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"10\">twins,</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"11\">zoo)</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"12\">into</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"13\">one</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"14\">group;</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"15\">researchers</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"16\">group</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"17\">people</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"18\">by</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"19\">DNA</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"20\">activity;</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"21\">DeepLearning.AI</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"22\">found</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"23\">three</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"24\">learner</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"25\">segments</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"26\">(growing</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"27\">skills,</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"28\">developing</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"29\">a</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"30\">career,</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"31\">staying</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"32\">updated).</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"1\">three</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"2\">main</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"3\">tasks:</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">داده فقط ورودی دارد. کسی به الگوریتم نمی‌گوید جواب‌ها چیست، پس خودش دنبال ساختار می‌گردد. مثال‌های Ng: Google News مقاله‌هایی را که کلمه‌های مشترک دارند (panda، twins، zoo) در یک گروه می‌گذارد؛ پژوهشگران آدم‌ها را بر اساس فعالیت DNA گروه‌بندی می‌کنند؛ DeepLearning.AI سه بخش از یادگیرندگان را پیدا کرد (رشد مهارت، توسعه‌ی شغلی، به‌روز ماندن). سه کار اصلی:</div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"0\">Clustering:</span></strong> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"1\">group</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"2\">similar</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"3\">examples.</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>خوشه‌بندی:</strong> نمونه‌های مشابه را گروه‌بندی کن.</div></li>\n<li><strong><span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"0\">Anomaly</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"1\">detection:</span></strong> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"2\">find</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"3\">unusual</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"4\">examples,</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"5\">such</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"6\">as</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"7\">fraud.</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>تشخیص ناهنجاری:</strong> نمونه‌های غیرعادی را پیدا کن، مثل تقلب.</div></li>\n<li><strong><span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"0\">Dimensionality</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"1\">reduction:</span></strong> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"2\">compress</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"3\">many</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"4\">features</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"5\">into</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"6\">a</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"7\">few</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"8\">while</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"9\">keeping</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"10\">most</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"11\">of</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"12\">the</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"13\">information.</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>کاهش بُعد:</strong> ویژگی‌های زیاد را به چند ویژگی فشرده کن و بیشتر اطلاعات را نگه دار.</div></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"h-23-reinforcement-learning\"><span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"0\">2.3</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"1\">Reinforcement</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"2\">learning</span></h4><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">2.3 یادگیری تقویتی</div>\n<p><span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"0\">An</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"1\">agent</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"2\">takes</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"3\">actions</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"4\">in</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"5\">an</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"6\">environment</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"7\">and</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"8\">receives</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"9\">rewards</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"10\">or</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"11\">penalties.</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"0\">It</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"1\">learns</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"2\">which</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"3\">actions</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"4\">earn</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"5\">the</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"6\">most</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"7\">reward</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"8\">over</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"9\">time.</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"0\">Famous</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"1\">examples:</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"2\">checkers</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"3\">(Samuel),</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"4\">Go</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"5\">(AlphaGo),</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"6\">and</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"7\">the</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"8\">training</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"9\">of</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"10\">reasoning</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"11\">LLMs,</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"12\">which</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"13\">were</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"14\">rewarded</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"15\">for</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"16\">correct</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"17\">answers.</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"0\">It</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"1\">is</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"2\">rare</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"3\">in</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"4\">lending,</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"5\">because</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"6\">you</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"7\">cannot</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"8\">let</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"9\">a</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"10\">model</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"11\">try</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"12\">random</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"13\">loans</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"14\">to</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"15\">see</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"16\">what</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"17\">happens,</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"18\">but</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"19\">it</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"20\">matters</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"21\">for</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"22\">understanding</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"23\">how</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"24\">modern</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"25\">LLMs</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"26\">are</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"27\">made.</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">یک <strong>عامل</strong> در یک <strong>محیط</strong> عمل می‌کند و <strong>پاداش</strong> یا جریمه می‌گیرد. یاد می‌گیرد کدام عمل‌ها در طول زمان بیشترین پاداش را می‌آورند. مثال‌های معروف: چکرز (Samuel)، Go (AlphaGo) و آموزش LLMهای استدلالی که برای جواب‌های درست پاداش می‌گرفتند. در وام‌دهی نادر است، چون نمی‌توانی بگذاری مدل وام‌های تصادفی را امتحان کند تا ببیند چه می‌شود، ولی برای فهمیدن اینکه LLMهای مدرن چطور ساخته می‌شوند مهم است.</div>\n<h4 id=\"h-24-side-by-side\"><span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"0\">2.4</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"1\">Side</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"2\">by</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"3\">side</span></h4><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">2.4 کنار هم</div>\n<div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Supervised</th>\n<th>Unsupervised</th>\n<th>Reinforcement</th>\n</tr>\n</thead><tbody><tr>\n<td>The data</td>\n<td>Inputs x with right answers y</td>\n<td>Inputs x only</td>\n<td>An environment that gives rewards</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>The goal</td>\n<td>Learn x to y, then predict y for a new x</td>\n<td>Find groups, patterns, oddities</td>\n<td>Choose actions that earn the most reward</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tasks</td>\n<td>Regression, classification</td>\n<td>Clustering, anomaly detection, dimensionality reduction</td>\n<td>Control, games, tuning LLMs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Loan example</td>\n<td>Monthly cost of an offer (regression); offer accepted or not (classification)</td>\n<td>Applicant segments; an unusual application</td>\n<td>Rare; a pricing policy learned from simulation</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<h4 id=\"h-25-choosing-the-family\"><span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"0\">2.5</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"1\">Choosing</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"2\">the</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"3\">family</span></h4><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">2.5 انتخاب خانواده</div>\n<div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr>\n<th>Question</th>\n<th>Answer</th>\n<th>Family and task</th>\n</tr>\n</thead><tbody><tr>\n<td>Do I have the right answers for past cases?</td>\n<td>Yes, and the answer is a number</td>\n<td>Supervised, regression</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>Yes, and the answer is a category</td>\n<td>Supervised, classification</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>No, and I want groups</td>\n<td>Unsupervised, clustering</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>No, and I want the odd ones out</td>\n<td>Unsupervised, anomaly detection</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>No, and I have too many columns</td>\n<td>Unsupervised, dimensionality reduction</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Must it choose actions and learn from their results?</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>Reinforcement learning</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<p><span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"0\">Quick</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"1\">tests</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"2\">from</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"3\">Ng's</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"4\">quiz:</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"5\">spam</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"6\">filtering</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"7\">and</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"8\">diabetes</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"9\">prediction</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"10\">are</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"11\">supervised</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"12\">(the</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"13\">answers</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"14\">are</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"15\">known);</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"16\">grouping</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"17\">news</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"18\">articles</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"19\">and</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"20\">finding</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"21\">market</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"22\">segments</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"23\">are</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"24\">unsupervised.</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">آزمون‌های سریع از کوییز Ng: فیلتر اسپم و پیش‌بینی دیابت نظارت‌شده‌اند (جواب‌ها معلوم‌اند)؛ گروه‌بندی مقاله‌های خبری و پیدا کردن بخش‌های بازار نظارت‌نشده‌اند.</div>\n<h4 id=\"h-26-self-supervised-learning\"><span data-s=\"43\" data-w=\"0\">2.6</span> <span data-s=\"43\" data-w=\"1\">Self-supervised</span> <span data-s=\"43\" data-w=\"2\">learning</span></h4><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">2.6 یادگیری خودنظارتی (Self-supervised)</div>\n<p><em><span data-s=\"44\" data-w=\"0\">Beyond</span> <span data-s=\"44\" data-w=\"1\">the</span> <span data-s=\"44\" data-w=\"2\">videos.</span></em> <span data-s=\"45\" data-w=\"0\">There</span> <span data-s=\"45\" data-w=\"1\">is</span> <span data-s=\"45\" data-w=\"2\">a</span> <span data-s=\"45\" data-w=\"3\">fourth</span> <span data-s=\"45\" data-w=\"4\">label</span> <span data-s=\"45\" data-w=\"5\">you</span> <span data-s=\"45\" data-w=\"6\">will</span> <span data-s=\"45\" data-w=\"7\">meet</span> <span data-s=\"45\" data-w=\"8\">when</span> <span data-s=\"45\" data-w=\"9\">reading</span> <span data-s=\"45\" data-w=\"10\">about</span> <span data-s=\"45\" data-w=\"11\">LLMs:</span> <span data-s=\"45\" data-w=\"12\">self-supervised</span> <span data-s=\"45\" data-w=\"13\">learning.</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"1\">training</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"2\">data</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"3\">comes</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"4\">with</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"5\">no</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"6\">human</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"7\">labels,</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"8\">but</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"9\">the</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"10\">labels</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"11\">are</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"12\">made</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"13\">from</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"14\">the</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"15\">data</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"16\">itself.</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"0\">An</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"1\">LLM</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"2\">reads</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"3\">a</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"4\">sentence</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"5\">with</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"6\">the</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"7\">next</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"8\">word</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"9\">hidden</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"10\">and</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"11\">learns</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"12\">to</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"13\">predict</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"14\">it.</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"1\">\"right</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"2\">answer\"</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"3\">is</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"4\">simply</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"5\">the</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"6\">next</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"7\">word</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"8\">of</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"9\">the</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"10\">text.</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"0\">This</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"1\">lets</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"2\">models</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"3\">learn</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"4\">from</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"5\">the</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"6\">entire</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"7\">internet</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"8\">without</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"9\">anyone</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"10\">labelling</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"11\">it.</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>بیرون از ویدیوها.</strong> برچسب چهارمی هست که هنگام خواندن درباره‌ی LLMها با آن روبه‌رو می‌شوی: <strong>یادگیری خودنظارتی</strong>. داده‌ی آموزشی برچسب انسانی ندارد، ولی برچسب‌ها از خود داده ساخته می‌شوند. یک LLM جمله‌ای را می‌خواند که کلمه‌ی بعدی‌اش پنهان است و یاد می‌گیرد آن را پیش‌بینی کند. «جواب درست» همان کلمه‌ی بعدی متن است. این اجازه می‌دهد مدل‌ها از کل اینترنت یاد بگیرند بدون اینکه کسی برچسب بزند.</div>\n<p><strong><span data-s=\"50\" data-w=\"0\">Loan</span> <span data-s=\"50\" data-w=\"1\">example.</span></strong> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"0\">A</span> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"1\">table</span> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"2\">of</span> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"3\">40,000</span> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"4\">past</span> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"5\">offers</span> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"6\">with</span> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"7\">a</span> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"8\">column</span> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"9\">Accepted</span> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"10\">(yes</span> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"11\">or</span> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"12\">no)</span> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"13\">is</span> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"14\">supervised</span> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"15\">classification</span> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"16\">data.</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"1\">same</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"2\">table</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"3\">without</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"4\">that</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"5\">column</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"6\">can</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"7\">still</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"8\">be</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"9\">clustered</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"10\">into</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"11\">customer</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"12\">types,</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"13\">but</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"14\">the</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"15\">groups</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"16\">come</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"17\">with</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"18\">no</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"19\">names</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"20\">and</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"21\">you</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"22\">must</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"23\">interpret</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"24\">them.</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>مثال وام.</strong> جدولی از 40,000 پیشنهاد گذشته با ستون <code>Accepted</code> (بله یا خیر) داده‌ی دسته‌بندی نظارت‌شده است. همان جدول بدون آن ستون را هم می‌شود به انواع مشتری خوشه‌بندی کرد، ولی گروه‌ها نام ندارند و باید خودت تفسیرشان کنی.</div>\n<p><strong><span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"0\">Common</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"1\">mistakes</span></strong></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>اشتباه‌های رایج</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"0\">Calling</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"1\">a</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"2\">clustering</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"3\">result</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"4\">a</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"5\">classification.</span> <span data-s=\"55\" data-w=\"0\">Clustering</span> <span data-s=\"55\" data-w=\"1\">has</span> <span data-s=\"55\" data-w=\"2\">no</span> <span data-s=\"55\" data-w=\"3\">known</span> <span data-s=\"55\" data-w=\"4\">classes.</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"0\">It</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"1\">invents</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"2\">groups,</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"3\">and</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"4\">you</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"5\">give</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"6\">them</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"7\">meaning</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"8\">afterwards.</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">نامیدن نتیجه‌ی خوشه‌بندی «دسته‌بندی». خوشه‌بندی دسته‌های معلوم ندارد. گروه‌ها را می‌سازد و بعد خودت به آن‌ها معنا می‌دهی.</div></li>\n<li><span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"0\">Using</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"1\">regression</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"2\">for</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"3\">a</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"4\">yes</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"5\">or</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"6\">no</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"7\">question</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"8\">just</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"9\">because</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"10\">the</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"11\">labels</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"12\">are</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"13\">0</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"14\">and</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"15\">1</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"16\">(Chapter</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"17\">9</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"18\">explains</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"19\">why</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"20\">that</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"21\">goes</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"22\">wrong).</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">استفاده از رگرسیون برای سؤال بله یا خیر فقط چون برچسب‌ها 0 و 1 هستند (فصل 9 توضیح می‌دهد چرا غلط از آب درمی‌آید).</div></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Check yourself</strong></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>خودت را بسنج</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li>Is \"predict whether a customer repays\" regression or classification? Why?<div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">آیا «پیش‌بینی اینکه مشتری وام را برمی‌گرداند یا نه» رگرسیون است یا دسته‌بندی؟ چرا؟</div></li>\n<li>Is \"find groups of similar loan applicants\" supervised or unsupervised?<div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">آیا «پیدا کردن گروه‌های مشابه از متقاضیان وام» نظارت‌شده است یا نظارت‌نشده؟</div></li>\n<li>Give one loan example of anomaly detection.<div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">یک مثال وام برای تشخیص ناهنجاری (anomaly detection) بزن.</div></li>\n<li>What is the label in supervised learning?<div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">در یادگیری نظارت‌شده، برچسب (label) چیست؟</div></li>\n</ul>\n<details class=\"answers\"><summary>Show answers</summary><p> (1) Classification: the answer is a category (repays or not). (2) Unsupervised: there is no right answer to learn from. (3) Flagging an application whose pattern differs from all previous ones, as a fraud check. (4) The right answer y that comes with each training example.</p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">(1) دسته‌بندی (classification): جواب یک دسته است (برمی‌گرداند یا نه). (2) نظارت‌نشده (unsupervised): جواب درستی برای یادگرفتن وجود ندارد. (3) علامت‌گذاری درخواستی که الگویش با همه‌ی درخواست‌های قبلی فرق دارد، به‌عنوان بررسی تقلب. (4) جواب درست <code>y</code> که همراه هر نمونه‌ی آموزشی می‌آید.</div></details>\n<p><strong>Go deeper:</strong> the scikit-learn <a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/machine_learning_map.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">algorithm cheat sheet</a> (it asks you questions and points to a method) · Ng, course 1, videos 4 to 8 · Infinite Codes, <a class=\"vlink\" href=\"#/watch/E0Hmnixke2g\">All Machine Learning algorithms explained in 17 min</a>.</p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>برای مطالعه‌ی بیشتر:</strong> برگه‌ی تقلب الگوریتم‌های scikit-learn (از تو سؤال می‌پرسد و به یک روش اشاره می‌کند) · Ng، درس 1، ویدیوهای 4 تا 8 · Infinite Codes، All Machine Learning algorithms explained in 17 min.</div>\n"}